{"title": "Oath of the Crown Tenets", "pageid": 48925, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Oath_of_the_Crown_Tenets", "categories": ["Class features", "Passive features", "Patch 8 content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Divine_Intervention_Arm_Thy_Servant.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Divine_Intervention_Arm_Thy_Servant.webp/300px-Divine_Intervention_Arm_Thy_Servant.webp, /w/images/8/89/Divine_Intervention_Arm_Thy_Servant.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Divine_Intervention_Arm_Thy_Servant.webp/300px-Divine_Intervention_Arm_Thy_Servant.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Divine_Intervention_Arm_Thy_Servant.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Oath of the Crown Tenets</b> is a passive feature that describes the tenets that <a href=\"/wiki/Oath_of_the_Crown\" title=\"Oath of the Crown\">Oath of the Crown</a> paladins must adhere to.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Oath of the Crown paladins abide by the following tenets:\n</p>\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:Georgia;\"> <b>Law.</b> Uphold civilisation and order.\n<p><b>Loyalty.</b> Your word is your bond; without loyalty, oaths and laws are meaningless.\n</p>\n<b>Responsibility.</b> Deal with the consequences of your actions, and fulfil your duties and obligations. </blockquote> \n<p>Failure to abide by their tenets will result in a paladin forsaking their Oath, and becoming something very different.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Oath_of_the_Crown\" title=\"Oath of the Crown\">Oath of the Crown</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li{margin:0;display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li::after{content:\" · \";font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .hlist li:last-child:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dd:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt:last-child::after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist li:last-child::after{content:none}.mw-parser-output .hlist dt:after,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dt::after{content:\":\";font-weight:normal;font-size:100%}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dd li:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dd:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt dt:first-child::before,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt li:first-child: